{% set current_page = 'admissions' %}
<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="zh"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>学校与申请要求 · 导师库</title>
<style>
.page-admissions main{max-width:1240px;margin:auto;padding:28px 24px 48px}.page-admissions .intro{margin:8px 0 24px;max-width:760px;line-height:1.65}.policy-target,.unit-summary,.application-checklist,.policy-card,.policy-disclosure,.policy-welcome{background:var(--card,#fff);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;min-width:0}
.policy-target{padding:20px;margin-bottom:24px}.policy-filters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.45fr 1.45fr 1fr .8fr 1fr;gap:16px}.policy-filters label{display:grid;gap:7px;font-size:13px;min-width:0}.policy-filters input,.policy-filters select{width:100%;min-width:0;max-width:none;padding:9px 10px;min-height:40px;background:var(--card,#fff)}.policy-target-more{margin-top:14px}.policy-target-more>summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent);font-size:13px;padding:6px 0}.policy-target-more .policy-filters{grid-template-columns:1fr 1.6fr 1fr;padding-top:14px}.policy-target-help{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin:12px 0 0;line-height:1.6}
.policy-welcome{padding:28px;margin-bottom:24px}.policy-welcome h2{margin:0 0 8px}.policy-welcome p{line-height:1.7;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 18px}.school-shortcuts{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}.school-shortcuts button{font-size:14px;min-height:40px}.policy-welcome-steps{display:flex;gap:24px;margin-top:24px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}.policy-welcome-steps strong{color:var(--ink);margin-right:6px}
.unit-summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:0 0 12px;margin-bottom:8px;border:0;background:transparent}.unit-summary h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 6px}.unit-summary p{margin:0;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}.actions{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}.actions a{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:40px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;text-decoration:none;font-size:14px}.actions a.primary{color:white;background:var(--accent);border-color:var(--accent)}
.application-checklist{padding:20px;margin:0 0 24px}.checklist-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px}.application-checklist h2{font-size:20px;margin:0 0 8px}.checklist-target,.checklist-help{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 14px}.checklist-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;align-items:start}.checklist-field{min-width:0;background:var(--bg,#f5f7f7);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:16px;line-height:1.7}.checklist-field h3{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 10px}.checklist-preview{font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;margin:9px 0}.checklist-clauses{padding-left:19px}.checklist-clauses li+li{margin-top:7px}.checklist-scope{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0}.checklist-field>details{margin-top:12px}.checklist-field summary{color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer;font-size:13px}.checklist-extra{margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:14px}.checklist-extra>summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent);font-size:14px}.checklist-extra .checklist-fields{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));margin-top:16px}.checklist-row{padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}.checklist-row p{margin:6px 0}.checklist-row blockquote,.policy-field blockquote{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);border-left:2px solid var(--line);padding-left:12px;margin:10px 0}.checklist-status{font-size:13px;color:var(--warn,#98601d);margin:6px 0}.checklist-status.checked{color:var(--accent)}.checklist-mentor{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-top:16px}.checklist-date{font-size:18px;font-weight:600;margin:10px 0 4px}.checklist-time-label{font-size:14px;margin:0}.checklist-empty{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px}.checklist-empty p{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}
.policy-section-heading{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:14px}.policy-section-heading h2{font-size:20px;margin:0}.stats,.scope,.policy-age{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65}.policy-section-heading .stats{margin:0}.policy-card{padding:20px;margin:0 0 12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere;scroll-margin-top:130px}.policy-card h2{font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;margin:6px 0 10px}.policy-card .scope{margin:0}.policy-card-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px 16px;flex-wrap:wrap}.policy-card-meta .policy-age{margin:0}.policy-quality{font-size:12px;display:inline-flex;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#fff4e4;color:var(--warn,#98601d)}.policy-quality.checked{background:var(--soft);color:var(--accent)}.policy-body{margin-top:14px}.policy-body>summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--accent);font-size:14px}.policy-body-content{padding-top:16px}.policy-fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:20px;margin:16px 0}.policy-field{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:14px;min-width:0}.policy-field h3{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px}.policy-field p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;margin:5px 0}.policy-evidence{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:12px;margin:14px 0}.policy-evidence>summary{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer}.policy-condition{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--warn,#98601d);margin:10px 0}.policy-condition-detail{font-size:13px}.quality{font-size:13px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--soft);border-radius:6px;line-height:1.75}.quality:not(.checked){background:#fff6e8;color:var(--warn,#98601d)}.policy-timing{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
.policy-disclosure{padding:16px 20px;margin:16px 0}.policy-disclosure>summary{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}.policy-disclosure[open]>summary{margin-bottom:16px}.admission-entry{padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.admission-entry p{margin:6px 0}.admission-entry a{font-size:14px}.entry-catalogs{margin-top:18px}.entry-catalogs p{margin:4px 0 12px}.layer-coverage-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px}.layer-coverage-grid h3{font-size:15px}.layer-coverage-grid p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.7}.unit-info{padding:16px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.unit-info h3{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 12px}.unit-metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.unit-metrics dt,.unit-metrics small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.unit-metrics dd{margin:5px 0;font-size:20px}.unit-metrics small{display:block}.unit-directory{min-width:0}.unit-directory h2{font-size:17px}.unit-directory button{text-align:left;min-height:44px;line-height:1.5}.unit-directory small{font-size:12px}#school-directory,#unit-directory-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:8px}.policy-footer{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7;margin-top:24px}.empty{padding:20px;border:1px dashed var(--line);border-radius:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;background:white}
@media(max-width:950px){.policy-filters{grid-template-columns:repeat(6,minmax(0,1fr))}.policy-filters>label{grid-column:span 2}.policy-filters>label:nth-child(-n+2){grid-column:span 3}.policy-target-more .policy-filters{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.policy-target-more .policy-filters>label{grid-column:auto}.policy-target-more .policy-filters>label:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}.checklist-fields{grid-template-columns:1fr}.checklist-extra .checklist-fields{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.unit-summary,.checklist-heading{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.policy-welcome-steps{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}}
@media(max-width:600px){.page-admissions main{padding:20px 14px 36px}.policy-target,.unit-summary,.application-checklist,.policy-card,.policy-disclosure{padding:16px}.policy-target{margin-bottom:16px}.policy-filters{gap:12px}.policy-filters>label{grid-column:span 3}.policy-filters>label:first-child,.policy-filters>label:nth-child(2){grid-column:span 3}.policy-filters>label:last-child{grid-column:1/-1}.policy-target-more .policy-filters{grid-template-columns:1fr}.policy-target-more .policy-filters>label{grid-column:1/-1}.checklist-extra .checklist-fields,.policy-fields,.layer-coverage-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.checklist-empty,.policy-section-heading{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.unit-metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.policy-welcome{padding:20px}.actions{gap:8px}.actions a{font-size:13px}.policy-card-meta{gap:8px}.policy-welcome-steps{display:grid;gap:12px}.policy-disclosure>summary{font-size:14px}}
</style>{% include '_ui_head.html.j2' %}</head><body class="page page-admissions">{% include '_nav.html.j2' %}<main>
<h1>学校与申请要求</h1><p class="intro muted">先看能否申请、准备什么、何时办理，再按需查看完整政策。</p>
<section class="policy-target" aria-label="申请目标">
<div class="policy-filters"><label>学校<select id="policy-school"></select></label><label>院系<select id="policy-dept"></select></label><label>入学年度<input id="policy-year" type="number" min="2000" max="2100" placeholder="不限年度"></label><label>申请学位<select id="policy-degree"><option value="">全部</option><option value="master">硕士</option><option value="phd">博士</option></select></label><label>申请渠道<select id="policy-route"><option value="">全部</option><option value="recommend">推免</option><option value="exam">统考</option><option value="assessment">申请考核</option></select></label></div>
<details id="policy-target-more" class="policy-target-more"><summary id="policy-target-more-label">进一步限定：普通／专项、专业与相关院系</summary><div class="policy-filters"><label>招生范围<select id="policy-track"><option value="">全部范围</option><option value="ordinary">普通招生</option><option value="special">专项/特定项目</option></select></label><label>专业／项目<select id="policy-program"><option value="">未指定（专业要求待核对）</option></select></label><label>相关院系方向<select id="policy-group"><option value="">全部相关院系</option></select></label></div><p class="policy-target-help">专业选项来自已整理的规则，不是完整招生目录。院系分类不代表接受你的本科专业；入学年度与本科毕业届别请分别核对。</p></details>
</section>
<section id="policy-welcome" class="policy-welcome"><h2>从你想申请的学校开始</h2><p>选择学校与院系，查看对应的申请要求和官方入口。填写申请目标后，可进一步核对材料与时间。</p><div id="school-shortcuts" class="school-shortcuts"></div><div class="policy-welcome-steps"><span><strong>1</strong>选择学校和院系</span><span><strong>2</strong>核对条件、材料与时间</span><span><strong>3</strong>找导师或准备申请</span></div></section>
<div id="policy-results" hidden>
<section id="unit-summary" class="unit-summary"><div><h2 id="unit-name"></h2><p id="unit-description"></p></div><div class="actions"><a id="unit-mentors">查看导师 →</a><a id="unit-notices">查看招生通知 →</a></div></section>
<section id="application-checklist" class="application-checklist" aria-live="polite"></section>
<section aria-label="对应政策"><div class="policy-section-heading"><h2>政策与要求</h2><p id="policy-count" class="stats" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></div><div id="policy-list"></div></section>
<details id="official-entry-details" class="policy-disclosure"><summary>官方招生入口与原文</summary><div id="unit-entries"></div></details>
<details id="policy-scope-details" class="policy-disclosure"><summary>信息覆盖、核验记录与师资入口</summary><section id="policy-layer-coverage" aria-live="polite"></section><p id="policy-coverage" class="stats"></p><div id="unit-readiness" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="unit-catalog"></div></details>
</div>
<details class="policy-disclosure policy-directory"><summary>浏览全部学校与相关院系</summary><aside class="unit-directory"><h2>当前学校院系</h2><div id="unit-directory-list"></div><h2>全部学校</h2><p class="stats">人数为本库记录，不是当前官方师资总数。</p><div id="school-directory"></div></aside></details>
<p class="policy-footer">摘要供准备参考；申请前请核对当年官方原文。信息未整理不代表没有要求，事项日期也不等于报名仍开放。</p>
</main><script src="admissions-data.js?v=20261116-maintenance1"></script><script src="admissions-core.js?v=20261116-flow1"></script><script src="material-actions.js?v=20261116-flow1"></script><script src="admissions.js?v=20261116-flow1"></script></body></html>
